; Custom messages used by WSLManager.iss (English). ASCII only.
[CustomMessages]
CommandLineToolGroup=Command-line tool:
AddToPathUser=Add the command-line tool (wslmgr) to my &PATH
AddToPathSystem=Add the command-line tool (wslmgr) to the system &PATH (all users)
PathNotUpdated=The PATH could not be updated, so the command-line tool (wslmgr) was not added to it. WSL Manager itself was installed.
ScheduledSnapshotNote=If you registered scheduled snapshots (wslmgr snapshot schedule create), delete them before you move or uninstall WSL Manager: run "wslmgr.exe snapshot schedule delete" from the install folder. They point at the installed wslmgr.exe by its full path, and the uninstaller does not remove them.
